  displayName: Ratman
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 99d7bedd9a203bf46b64f9a4d7f48a21, type: 3}
  description: 'Ratmen are the primary representatives of the ratkin kind - rat-like
    creatures twisted toward humanoid form: medium-sized, hunched figures with furred
    bodies and long tails. They move with quick, nervous, darting steps, faster than
    most humans at a run. Unlike giant rats, they use harsh, rasping speech, mixing
    chittering with words as they scheme and shout to one another.'
